{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\RePod\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/PageController.php:35 OCP\\AppFramework\\Http\\ContentSecurityPolicy: deprecated since Nextcloud 14; Use one of our stricter CSP policies"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 32 to 33. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/PageController.php:35 OCP\\AppFramework\\Http\\ContentSecurityPolicy: deprecated since Nextcloud 14; Use one of our stricter CSP policies"
      ]
    },
